<title>FINLAND: CULTOR 8-MTH SALES, PROFIT BY DIVISION.</title>
<headline>CULTOR 8-MTH SALES, PROFIT BY DIVISION.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish foodstuffs, animal feed</p>
<p>and bakery group Cultor Oy gave the following breakdown of its</p>
<p>January-August result (million markka):</p>
<p>    Net sales:		Jan-Aug 96   Jan-Aug 95   Jan-Dec 95</p>
<p> Nutrition			  2,959	  2,619	  4,155</p>
<p> Baking				 640	    552	    835</p>
<p> Food science*		    1,286	    451	    641</p>
<p> Feed ingredients		   252	    234	    341</p>
<p> Others and internal invoicing  224	    161	    229</p>
<p> TOTAL				5,361	  4,017	  6,201</p>
<p>    Operating profit:     Jan-Aug 96   Jan-Aug 95   Jan-Dec 95</p>
<p> Nutrition			    139	    242	    380</p>
<p> Baking				  55	     50	     62</p>
<p> Food science*			 98	     81	     96</p>
<p> Feed ingredients		    41	     25	     46</p>
<p> Others				 -32	    -38	    -56</p>
<p> TOTAL				  301	    360	    528</p>
<p>*Comparable periods excluding Food Science businesses</p>
<p>acquired in 1996. Others include Genencor, Cultor Technology</p>
<p>Center, Headquarters and eliminations for internal transactions,</p>
<p>Cultor said.</p>
<p>--Helsinki Newsroom  +358 - 0 - 680 50 245</p>
